node_modules/
dist/
# Every .env variant, not just the two that were thought of. A file named
# `.env.backup-20260821` carries exactly the same secrets as `.env`, and this
# repository is public, so the pattern has to cover the copies people actually
# make rather than the ones anticipated here. `.env.example` is exempted: it is
# the documented shape, and every value in it is empty or a local default.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.log
.DS_Store
coverage/
